2026-11-07T05:36:52.7689000Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8219980Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8255600Z [0m
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8256320Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8258100Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8263100Z 
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8263610Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8268010Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8277380Z 
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8277840Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8278450Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8278630Z 
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8279030Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [351..356])[0m and groups [34m(gid 350)[0m
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8279530Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8279960Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8280310Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8280460Z 
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8280650Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8280860Z 
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8281080Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8281420Z    can use Nix.
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8281520Z 
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8281610Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8281760Z 
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8281990Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8282990Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8293280Z 
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8293580Z I will:
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8293720Z 
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8294030Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8295010Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8295470Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8295850Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8296090Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8296360Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8296840Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8297250Z    /var/root
2026-11-07T05:36:52.8326780Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
